-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- the hop by projectors
-- Every vertex the hop's √V acts on has M with minimal polynomial x − μ, x(x − μ) or x, so √V = μ^{1/8}/√2 · M/μ (M/μ the
-- projector onto μ's eigenspace; √V = 0 where μ = 0). A term is then (μ₁μ₂)^{1/8} (the ½ of the two 1/√2 is in the
-- kind's coefficient) times one rational map: no root sums.
mu-of : List SQ → SQ
mu-of m = if eqb (m-deg m) (suc zero) then sq-neg (sq-nth zero m) else (if eqb (m-deg m) 2 then sq-neg (sq-nth (suc zero) m) else sq-zero)
